    "chunk_text": "Hu micel goldes w\u00e6s Salomone broht \u00e6ghwylce d\u00e6ge. \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s feower \u00f0usenda & syx & syxtig talentana. On \u00e6lcre talentan w\u00e6s LXXX punda. Swa micel w\u00e6s gebroht on \u00f0am temple, butan \u00feam \u00fee him fram cypemannum com, & fram cyningum, & On salomones tide w\u00e6s gold swa genihtsum, & seolfor on hierusalem swa stanas ofer eor\u00f0an. Hu nyt bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0eah \u00feu \u00f0e ealne middaneard & ealle eor\u00f0an wille gestrynan, gif \u00feu \u00feinre sawle unfreme.",
